    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JESSICA: MS. HELLER, mind if I tag along on your field trip? I'm thinking of doing a story on your special needs class.\nMS. HELLER: I'm not interested. Not after the smear story you did on my chicken sushi.\nJESSICA: Well, when 200 students are hospitalized with stomach cramps I think it's newsworthy.\nMS. HELLER: Nevertheless, you could have mentioned the sauce. Well, I see you have a camera.",
      "MS. HELLER: I thought I told you to get lost.\nJESSICA: Look Ms. Heller, there's something fishy here, and I don't think it's Friday's special.\nMS. HELLER: I wouldn't know. Being that I'm just the teacher and all.\nMARGIE: You ever have one of those days when you just want to drive the bus into a wall and end it all? Okay, everyone in.",
      "MS. HELLER: People! Come on. \"Parade\" float.\nCHING CHONG: Ting tao kuun jahn leeka leeka powww.",
      "TERRI: We're gonna look like idiots.\nMS. HELLER: Exactly.",
      "MRS. HELLER: Well I just have one word for you. Aloha. The one that means goodbye!\nJESSICA: Don't worry about me, I'll be fine. I can take care of myself and I'm getting the story every high school reporter dreams of."
    ]
  },
